  "solution": {
    "text": "For Balmer $\\mathrm{n}_{1}=2$ and $\\mathrm{n}_{2}=3$; $v=R\\left(\\frac{1}{2^{2}}-\\frac{1}{3^{2}}\\right)=\\frac{5 R}{36} \\mathrm{~cm}^{-1}$"
